  "prefLabel": "Occ 102.04 Occupational therapist",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Occ 102.04 “Occupational therapist” means “occupational therapist” as defined in RSA 326-C:1, II, namely, “a person currently licensed to practice occupational therapy in the state of New Hampshire.”\n\nSource. #8572, eff 1-26-05; ss by #13081, eff 7-31-20 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Occ 100); ss by #14366, eff 9-9-25 (from Occ 102.02)",
